---
// Componente de widget para la distribución de categorías
---
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-300/80 bg-white/70 p-6 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,26,110,0.015)] backdrop-blur-md">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-4 mb-5">
